<div class="pictures4desk">
<div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-1459/PuppyCC.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="PuppyCC.jpg" class="image" />
<div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;">
<p>An instance of SCP-1459-1.</p>
</div>
